<!--
  Minimal entitlements for a future Épurer.app.

  Security policy (do not weaken without an explicit product decision):
  - No App Sandbox exemption that implies root.
  - No SMPrivilegedExecutables / no privileged helper.
  - No com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation unless notarization forces a review.
  - Full Disk Access is a user TCC grant in System Settings, not an entitlement.
-->
